WEBVTT

00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:07,430
Alternative cancer treatment? Well, I would say that it starts with asking better questions,

00:00:07,430 --> 00:00:15,070
maybe asking more questions. Certainly asking the question, why? Alternative cancer treatment

00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:24,150
is not putting yourself in a box. It's looking at yourself as a unique individual with very

00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:33,310
specific unique needs. Just because you have a disease, a name, a name of a cancer, a

00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:39,110
breast cancer, does not mean that your cancer is the same as any other of the million people

00:00:39,110 --> 00:00:45,990
with that same named disease. How is your body sustaining it? How is your body fueling

00:00:45,990 --> 00:00:51,570
this cancer? Those are questions that you need to ask. And certainly your exposure to

00:00:51,570 --> 00:00:58,890
environmental, chemical, biological toxins throughout your entire life has played a part

00:00:58,890 --> 00:01:04,490
in this. Your current diet and how it's being fueled plays a part in this. Your current

00:01:04,490 --> 00:01:11,890
stress level, your emotional and spiritual state, and your genetics play a part in how this

00:01:11,890 --> 00:01:18,530
cancer is continuing to grow. So those are the things that need to be discovered and looked

00:01:18,530 --> 00:01:25,050
at and addressed. So to me, alternative cancer treatment is really recognizing that each person

00:01:25,050 --> 00:01:32,650
is worth more than just a standard boxed protocol. This is the way we do it for all our breast

00:01:32,650 --> 00:01:37,970
cancer patients or prostate cancer patients. It's looking at each person as an individual

00:01:37,970 --> 00:01:44,650
and addressing these questions. Even if a person is continuing to do standards of care,

00:01:44,650 --> 00:01:48,890
more you could address these kind of questions and help your immune system and help your

00:01:48,890 --> 00:01:53,050
body. I just think you're going to get a lot better success.

